# Same bytes on every operating system.
#
# The team is split across Linux and Windows. Without this, a Windows clone with
# core.autocrlf=true rewrites every .py and .md to CRLF, and the first `git diff`
# after a pull shows the whole repository as changed.
#
# Rules are explicit rather than `* text=auto`, so nothing is normalised by
# surprise. The extracted PDF text is marked -text on purpose: it is the output
# of an extraction step and should keep exactly the bytes it was produced with.

*.py    text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.html  text eol=lf
*.svg   text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf

*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.pptx  binary
*.rar   binary

02_Sumber/extracted/*.txt -text
